{"seq":3,"slug":"intel-usage-audit","title":"情报使用审计与效果度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/fraud-intelligence-sharing-network/intel-governance/intel-usage-audit","wordCount":2461,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"情报使用审计与效果度量\">情报使用审计与效果度量</h1><p>前两篇定了两条规则：错的情报要被隔离，共享的内容要是最小集。这一篇回答一个不同的问题——<strong>怎么知道它们真的在运行</strong>。审计回答「谁在什么时候用了哪条情报做了什么决定」，度量回答「这条情报的实际收益是正的还是负的」。缺了度量，一个情报体系会持续运营一批已经失效、甚至净有害的条目，而且没人会发现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-审计要记录的四个要素\">核心概念：审计要记录的四个要素</h2><p>审计日志的设计原则是<strong>记录决策而不是记录数据</strong>。一份「谁访问了情报库」的日志几乎没有价值；一份「某商户在某时刻用某版情报对某主体做了某决定」的日志才可用。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>要素</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n<th>为什么必须记</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>主体</td>\n<td>被决策的对象的本地引用</td>\n<td>撤销时定位受影响用户；注意不记录可直接还原身份的明文</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>情报引用</td>\n<td><code>(intel_id, version)</code></td>\n<td>撤销时确定版本区间；度量时按情报聚合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>决策</td>\n<td>决策类型与结果</td>\n<td>度量效果；发现未授权的使用方式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>上下文</td>\n<td>消费方、时间、请求来源</td>\n<td>追责；配额与异常检测</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第三个要素里的「决策类型」需要与共享对象的使用约束对照。如果一条情报的 <code>allowed_decisions</code> 只有 <code>[&quot;manual_review&quot;]</code>，而审计里出现了 <code>auto_block</code>，这就是一次越权使用——这个检查可以自动化，也应该自动化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"审计日志的存储与不可篡改性\">审计日志的存储与不可篡改性</h2><p>审计日志的价值取决于它的可信度。如果日志可以被修改，它在事后追责场景里就没有意义。可选的手段按强度递增：应用层只追加写（最弱，只防误删）、按月分区加链式哈希（中，防普通篡改）、外部只追加对象存储（强，需运维配合）、透明日志（最强，可抗运营方抵赖）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"链式哈希的构造\">链式哈希的构造</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 审计日志：追加写、按月分区、关键字段做链式哈希&#10;CREATE TABLE intel_usage_audit (&#10;  audit_id     BIGSERIAL,&#10;  occurred_at  TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  consumer_id  TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  intel_id     TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  intel_version INT NOT NULL,&#10;  subject_ref  TEXT NOT NULL,       -- 消费方本地哈希，不可还原身份&#10;  decision_type TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  decision_result TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  request_source TEXT,&#10;  prev_hash    BYTEA NOT NULL,&#10;  row_hash     BYTEA NOT NULL,      -- H(prev_hash || 本行规范化字段)&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (audit_id, occurred_at)&#10;) PARTITION BY RANGE (occurred_at);&#10;&#10;-- 保留策略：审计日志 24 个月，逾期归档而非删除&#10;CREATE TABLE intel_usage_audit_2026_09 PARTITION OF intel_usage_audit&#10;  FOR VALUES FROM (&#39;2026-09-01&#39;) TO (&#39;2026-10-01&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 审计日志：追加写、按月分区、关键字段做链式哈希</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> intel_usage_audit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  audit_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  occurred_at  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  consumer_id  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  intel_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  intel_version </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  subject_ref  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,       </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 消费方本地哈希，不可还原身份</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  decision_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  decision_result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  request_source </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  prev_hash    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BYTEA</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  row_hash     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BYTEA</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,      </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- H(prev_hash || 本行规范化字段)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (audit_id, occurred_at)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> RANGE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (occurred_at);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 保留策略：审计日志 24 个月，逾期归档而非删除</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> intel_usage_audit_2026_09</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> OF intel_usage_audit</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FOR</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2026-09-01'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2026-10-01'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>row_hash = H(prev_hash || fields)</code> 让任何对历史行的修改都会破坏后续所有行的哈希链，从而被检测到。它的强度不如外部不可篡改存储，但成本低得多，足以防御内部误操作与普通篡改。若需要防止运营方自身抵赖，可以进一步参照 Certificate Transparency 的思路：把审计摘要定期发布到一个只追加的 Merkle 树日志中，日志用带域分隔前缀的哈希构造——叶子为 <code>H(0x00 || entry)</code>、内部节点为 <code>H(0x01 || left || right)</code>，任何一方都能用包含证明与一致性证明验证某个时间点的日志未被改写（<a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9162.html\">RFC 9162</a>）。</p>\n<p>保留期应当按「申诉与争议的可能时间跨度」设定。反欺诈场景下 24 个月是常见的下限——拒付、监管问询、集体投诉的时间窗通常长于一般业务。</p>\n<h3 id=\"审计与决策的关联必须双向\">审计与决策的关联必须双向</h3><p>单向的关联（从审计能找到情报）不够用。治理动作几乎都从另一头发起：「这条情报最近被谁用了」——这需要从情报反查审计，因此 <code>(intel_id, version, occurred_at)</code> 上的索引不是可选的优化，而是功能的一部分。缺少它会让撤销影响面评估退化成全表扫描，在实际数据量下不可用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"效果度量-给一条情报算收益\">效果度量：给一条情报算收益</h2><p>度量的核心是一次成本收益计算。这里的难点不在公式，而在<strong>把反事实算清楚</strong>——你不能只统计「命中这条情报的欺诈有多少」，因为其中很多会被别的机制拦下。</p>\n<h3 id=\"四个基础量\">四个基础量</h3><p>对一条情报，在给定的观察期内统计：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>命中且事后确认为欺诈的量</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>F</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>命中但被推翻的量</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">TP = \\text{命中且事后确认为欺诈的量}, \\quad FP = \\text{命中但被推翻的量}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">命中且事后确认为欺诈的量</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">命中但被推翻的量</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>单次漏判的平均损失</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>单次误判的平均成本</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = \\text{单次漏判的平均损失}, \\quad C = \\text{单次误判的平均成本}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">单次漏判的平均损失</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">单次误判的平均成本</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><code>L</code> 是资金损失、拒付、赔付加运营成本；<code>C</code> 包含用户补偿、客服成本、以及品牌与流失价值。注意 <code>FP</code> 是申诉成立的量，它是真实误伤率的<strong>下界</strong>——沉默流失的用户没有被计入。因此在算净收益时必须给 <code>FP</code> 乘一个保守的膨胀系数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>NetValue</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>T</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>F</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>C</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>λ</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{NetValue} = TP \\cdot L - \\lambda \\cdot FP \\cdot C, \\qquad \\lambda \\geq 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">NetValue</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><code>λ</code> 的取值应当从抽样调研或流失分析中得到，而不是拍脑袋。如果无从估计，取 <code>λ = 3</code> 是一个保守的起点，它的含义是「每一起成立申诉背后至少还有两起未申诉的误伤」。</p>\n<h3 id=\"提升量才是真正的收益\">提升量才是真正的收益</h3><p>上面的公式有一处高估：<code>TP</code> 里有一部分即使没有这条情报也会被拦下（被其它规则、模型、或人工流程捕获）。真正属于这条情报的收益是<strong>增量</strong>。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>IncrementalValue</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>with</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>without</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>F</mi><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>with</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>F</mi><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>without</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{IncrementalValue} = (TP_{\\text{with}} - TP_{\\text{without}}) \\cdot L - \\lambda \\cdot (FP_{\\text{with}} - FP_{\\text{without}}) \\cdot C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">IncrementalValue</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">with</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">without</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">with</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">without</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><code>without</code> 情形不能靠关停情报来测量（代价太高），必须用离线回放：拿历史决策日志，把这条情报从输入中去掉，重跑决策逻辑，看决策有多少变化。这要求决策逻辑是可回放的——这也是为什么 <a href=\"../fraud-intel-production/confirmed-fraud-feedback\">确诊欺诈回流与样本沉淀</a> 要求样本必须带决策时刻的特征快照。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三条经验规则\">三条经验规则</h3><p><strong>规则一：高命中低增量的情报应该退役。</strong> 一条命中量巨大但增量收益接近零的情报，实际上是在消耗审核容量、制造误伤、并稀释其它情报的信号。它看起来很「有用」只是因为它的绝对命中数高。</p>\n<p><strong>规则二：按消费方分别度量。</strong> 同一条情报在不同消费方手里的净收益可能完全不同。商户 A 的数据质量高、行动克制，净收益是正的；商户 B 用它自动封禁，误伤成本远超收益。此时正确的动作不是下线这条情报，而是<strong>收窄它在 B 侧的使用约束</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>规则三：度量必须闭环到状态。</strong> 净收益连续为负的情报应当自动进入 <a href=\"intel-falsepositive-quarantine\">误报隔离与申诉纠正</a> 定义的 <code>degraded</code> 状态。不闭环的度量只是报表，没有约束力。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[线上决策消费情报] --&gt; B[审计日志&lt;br/&gt;决策四要素]&#10;  B --&gt; C[outcome 延迟回填&lt;br/&gt;拒付/申诉/审核]&#10;  C --&gt; D[按情报聚合&lt;br/&gt;TP / FP / 消费方]&#10;  D --&gt; E[计算净增量价值]&#10;  E --&gt; F{越权使用?}&#10;  F --&gt;|是| G[收窄使用约束&lt;br/&gt;最高优先级]&#10;  F --&gt;|否| H{净价值为负?}&#10;  H --&gt;|是| I[转入 degraded 状态]&#10;  H --&gt;|否| J[保留并刷新有效期]&#10;  G --&gt; K[回写情报状态]&#10;  I --&gt; K&#10;  J --&gt; K&#10;  K --&gt; A\">graph TD\n  A[线上决策消费情报] --&gt; B[审计日志&lt;br/&gt;决策四要素]\n  B --&gt; C[outcome 延迟回填&lt;br/&gt;拒付/申诉/审核]\n  C --&gt; D[按情报聚合&lt;br/&gt;TP / FP / 消费方]\n  D --&gt; E[计算净增量价值]\n  E --&gt; F{越权使用?}\n  F --&gt;|是| G[收窄使用约束&lt;br/&gt;最高优先级]\n  F --&gt;|否| H{净价值为负?}\n  H --&gt;|是| I[转入 degraded 状态]\n  H --&gt;|否| J[保留并刷新有效期]\n  G --&gt; K[回写情报状态]\n  I --&gt; K\n  J --&gt; K\n  K --&gt; A</pre><h2 id=\"一个可运行的度量视图\">一个可运行的度量视图</h2><p>把上述逻辑落成一条查询，按情报逐个计算净增量价值与建议动作。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"WITH observed AS (&#10;  SELECT&#10;    a.intel_id,&#10;    a.intel_version,&#10;    count(*) FILTER (WHERE a.outcome = &#39;confirmed_fraud&#39;) AS tp,&#10;    count(*) FILTER (WHERE a.outcome = &#39;false_positive&#39;)  AS fp,&#10;    count(DISTINCT a.consumer_id)                          AS consumers,&#10;    count(*) FILTER (WHERE a.decision_type NOT IN (&#10;      SELECT jsonb_array_elements_text(i.use_constraint -&gt; &#39;allowed_decisions&#39;)&#10;      FROM fraud_intel i WHERE i.intel_id = a.intel_id&#10;    ))                                                     AS unauthorized_uses&#10;  FROM intel_usage_audit a&#10;  WHERE a.occurred_at &gt; now() - interval &#39;90 days&#39;&#10;    AND a.outcome IS NOT NULL&#10;  GROUP BY a.intel_id, a.intel_version&#10;)&#10;SELECT&#10;  intel_id,&#10;  intel_version,&#10;  tp,&#10;  fp,&#10;  ROUND(tp * :loss - 3.0 * fp * :cost, 2) AS net_value,&#10;  unauthorized_uses,&#10;  CASE&#10;    WHEN unauthorized_uses &gt; 0 THEN &#39;restrict_usage&#39;&#10;    WHEN tp * :loss - 3.0 * fp * :cost &lt; 0 THEN &#39;degrade&#39;&#10;    WHEN tp + fp &lt; 30 THEN &#39;insufficient_data&#39;&#10;    ELSE &#39;keep&#39;&#10;  END AS suggested_action&#10;FROM observed&#10;ORDER BY net_value ASC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> observed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">intel_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">intel_version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">outcome</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'confirmed_fraud'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tp,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">outcome</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'false_positive'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fp,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">consumer_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> consumers,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">decision_type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> jsonb_array_elements_text(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">use_constraint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'allowed_decisions'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fraud_intel i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">intel_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">intel_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ))                                                     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> unauthorized_uses</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> intel_usage_audit a</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">occurred_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> interval </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'90 days'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">outcome</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">intel_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">intel_version</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  intel_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  intel_version,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  tp,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  fp,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  ROUND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(tp </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :loss </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fp </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :cost, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> net_value,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  unauthorized_uses,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CASE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> unauthorized_uses </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'restrict_usage'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tp </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :loss </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fp </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :cost </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'degrade'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tp </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fp </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 30</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'insufficient_data'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'keep'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  END</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> suggested_action</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> observed</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> net_value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ASC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>unauthorized_uses</code> 这个指标优先级最高：越权使用是治理失效的直接证据，其严重性超过收益的正负——一次越权使用可能已经造成了不可撤回的信息暴露。</p>\n<h2 id=\"度量本身的偏差\">度量本身的偏差</h2><p>最后必须提醒度量方法的三个系统性偏差，它们会让看起来在正常运转的度量失真。不识别这些偏差，一套度量体系会给出稳定的、但方向错误的结论。</p>\n<p><strong>幸存者偏差。</strong> 只有被决策的对象才有 <code>outcome</code> 回流，而未被决策的对象永远没有结果。因此 <code>TP/FP</code> 的比例反映的是<strong>决策边界附近</strong>的分布，不是情报整体的质量。一条情报如果把所有人都拦下，它的 <code>TP</code> 会很高，<code>FP</code> 会因为申诉率低（很多人懒得申诉）而看起来很低。</p>\n<p><strong>回流延迟。</strong> 拒付确认以月计，所以最近 30 天的数据必然不完整。度量窗口必须留出足够的成熟期，或在查询里显式排除未成熟的区间。忽略这一点会让新上线的情报看起来收益很差——只是因为它的结果还没回来。</p>\n<p><strong>消费方差异导致的选择偏差。</strong> 如果只有一小部分消费方回传结果，度量反映的是那部分消费方的行为。回传率本身应当是一个被监控的指标。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>偏差</th>\n<th>表现</th>\n<th>缓解方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>幸存者偏差</td>\n<td>全拦型情报看起来完美</td>\n<td>用抽样人工复核未拦截样本做对照</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>回流延迟</td>\n<td>新情报收益被低估</td>\n<td>成熟期窗口 + 排除未成熟区间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>消费方选择偏差</td>\n<td>整体结论被少数活跃方主导</td>\n<td>监控回传率，低于阈值时标注置信度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>λ</code> 取值过低</td>\n<td>误伤成本被系统性低估</td>\n<td>用流失分析回填，而非沿用默认值</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>审计记录决策而非数据：主体本地引用、<code>(intel_id, version)</code>、决策类型与结果、上下文四要素；<code>decision_type</code> 必须与使用约束对照以发现越权。</li>\n<li>审计日志按月分区、追加写、链式哈希（<code>row_hash = H(prev_hash || fields)</code>），保留期按争议时间跨度设定（反欺诈常见下限 24 个月）；需要抗运营方抵赖时可参照 CT 的只追加 Merkle 日志（叶子 <code>H(0x00||entry)</code>、内部节点 <code>H(0x01||left||right)</code>）。</li>\n<li>审计与情报的关联必须双向可查，<code>(intel_id, version, occurred_at)</code> 索引是功能而非优化。</li>\n<li>效果度量的核心是<strong>增量</strong>而非命中量：<code>IncrementalValue = (TP_with - TP_without)·L − λ·(FP_with - FP_without)·C</code>，<code>λ ≥ 1</code> 反映未申诉误伤，<code>without</code> 情形靠离线回放获得。</li>\n<li>三条经验规则：高命中低增量应退役、按消费方分别度量并收窄使用约束、度量必须闭环回情报状态。</li>\n<li>度量自身有四类偏差：幸存者偏差、回流延迟、消费方选择偏差、<code>λ</code> 取值过低；每一项都需要对应的缓解手段，否则度量会给出稳定的错误结论。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>到这里四章构成完整闭环：情报被生产、连成图谱、跨边界流动、并被持续治理。任何一环缺失，其余三环的价值都会迅速衰减——一个没有审计的共享系统在第一次监管问询时就会停摆，一个没有图谱的情报库只能做静态名单，一个没有补齐情报生产的图谱则是无源之水。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"情报使用审计与效果度量","id":"情报使用审计与效果度量"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：审计要记录的四个要素","id":"核心概念-审计要记录的四个要素"},{"level":2,"text":"审计日志的存储与不可篡改性","id":"审计日志的存储与不可篡改性"},{"level":3,"text":"链式哈希的构造","id":"链式哈希的构造"},{"level":3,"text":"审计与决策的关联必须双向","id":"审计与决策的关联必须双向"},{"level":2,"text":"效果度量：给一条情报算收益","id":"效果度量-给一条情报算收益"},{"level":3,"text":"四个基础量","id":"四个基础量"},{"level":3,"text":"提升量才是真正的收益","id":"提升量才是真正的收益"},{"level":3,"text":"三条经验规则","id":"三条经验规则"},{"level":2,"text":"一个可运行的度量视图","id":"一个可运行的度量视图"},{"level":2,"text":"度量本身的偏差","id":"度量本身的偏差"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"隐私边界与最小共享","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/fraud-intelligence-sharing-network/intel-governance/privacy-boundary-min-share"},"next":null}